;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; MOD for longs. Small cases use divs (remainder with the sign of the dividend); a divisor larger than the dividend
; leaves the dividend; the rest goes through a shift-and-subtract division whose remainder is positive, negated for a
; negative divisor. A zero divisor raises error 0.
