;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Waits for a key for the line editor. Alternate with a key that has no character gives the scan code with bit 7 set.
; Ctrl+S makes the next key a high character (bit 7 toggled); Ctrl+A followed by decimal digits enters a control code
; below 26.
; Exit: d0.b = character (0 for a cursor or function key, scan code in the upper word).
