;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; CURVE x0,y0,x1,y1,x2,y2,x3,y3: draws a cubic Bezier curve as a 33-point polyline (v_pline). The curve is\nP0 + c*t +
; b*t^2 + a*t^3 with t = i/32, worked out in integers scaled by 2^15 and rounded. The loop also\nworks out a 34th point
; (t = 33/32) after the 33 that are drawn.\nEntry: d1/d2 = P0, d3/d4 = P1, d5/d6 = P2, d7/d0 = P3 (x/y)\nExit: through
; Xvdi; d0-d7/a0-a2 changed
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
